abstract: >-
  A practitioner operating model for the AI Quality Engineer role in the
  agentic AI era. The work connects conventional software quality engineering
  with LLM and RAG evaluation, agent trajectory testing, prompt regression,
  identity and authorization, human approval, AI security, observability,
  performance and cost engineering, CI/CD quality gates and
  production-to-regression learning. It introduces an
  Understand-Model-Evaluate-Control-Observe-Learn model for converting AI
  uncertainty into measurable quality contracts, reproducible evidence and
  governed release decisions.
